<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Now consider the rest of the list of your similar product/ apps. Rank them in terms of their UI design. Which products/ apps are easy to use and seem to just work? Write down the reasons that some products/ apps are easier to use than others. Did you know what to do immediately? How many steps did it take to start using the product effectively? How many taps did it take to get going on the app? \(The answer should be \217very few\220.\) First impressions count. Compare your notes with other students. Did you agree on the reasons?)/Pg 38 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

